## 🔴 CRITICAL — System kaam nahi karega

**1. `strategy.py` — BUY order kabhi place hi nahi hoga**
```python
if signal["action"] == "BUY":
    # ... place_buy_order ...   ← SIRF COMMENT HAI! Actual call nahi hai!
    open_count += 1
```
Poora system signal detect karega, war room approve karega, lekin order kabhi jayega hi nahi. Yeh sabse bada bug hai.

