**2. `kotak_client.py` — Async event loop block ho jaayega**
```python
# _create_and_login() mein:
time.sleep(2)   ← BLOCKING call async context mein
```
`startup()` async function hai. Pehli baar login hote waqt `time.sleep(2)` poora event loop freeze kar deta hai — strategy loop, scheduler, sab ruk jaate hain. `await asyncio.sleep(2)` nahi hai kyunki yeh sync function hai, but calling context async hai.

