model_name = "gemini-flash-latest"   ← Yeh exist nahi karta
```
Sahi naam hai `"gemini-1.5-flash-latest"` ya `"gemini-2.0-flash-latest"`. Har Gemini call — fundamental analyst aur morning screener dono — fail ho jaayenge silently, `_error_response()` return karega, aur tumhe pata bhi nahi chalega kyun.

