stop_dist = abs(price - stop_loss)   ← exact duplicate, dono ek hi line
```
Harmless abhi, lekin uske neeche jo fallback logic hai wo pehle `stop_dist` calculate karne se pehle check karna chahiye tha. Order ka ek bhi yeh hai.

