**6. `orchestrator.py` — War room time budget ka math**

```
AGENT_SLEEP = 40 seconds
Per stock (worst case) = 7 agent calls × 40s sleep = 280s ≈ 5 minutes
4 stocks × 5 min + inter-stock sleep = ~22 minutes
WAR_ROOM_INTERVAL = 30 minutes
```
Iska matlab: war room khatam hone se pehle hi agli war room schedule hogi. `max_instances=1` hai toh skip ho jaayegi — lekin effectively war room sirf ek baar chalegi practically.

